    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Charisma 13+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Impersonation.</strong> While disguised as a real or fictional person, you have Advantage on Charisma (Deception or Performance) checks made to convince others that you are that person.</p><p><strong>Mimicry.</strong> You can imitate the sounds of other creatures, including speech. A creature that hears the imitation must succeed on a Wisdom (Insight) check (DC 8 plus your Charisma modifier and Proficiency Bonus) to realize it is fake.</p>",
